D) As topics to address after the plan is baselined
= A
? Subsidiary plans for critical areas such as safety and environment are integrated into the project management plan.

@@ PR1 | Agile
In an agile project, how far ahead should the team plan in detail?
A) In detail for the next sprint, with the release plan refined each sprint
B) In detail for the whole release, so that every task is known in advance
C) Only one day ahead, since agile teams avoid planning beyond the daily scrum
D) In detail for the whole product life cycle, updated once a year by the PMO
= A
? Agile planning is layered: detailed for the near term (sprint), coarser for releases and roadmaps, and revisited frequently.

@@ PR1 | Hybrid
A media company is producing a documentary series (with a fixed shooting schedule) and a companion streaming platform built iteratively. How should the project manager plan the work?
